					The phantom does not generate soul essence

					Killing an enemy with the phantom releases a life spirit
					This spirit seeks out your ally with the lowest life and heals them for 2 life
					'''
				DisplayName: Spirit Fire Scythe
			}

			SoulOfScythe: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					'The very soul of the scythe'

					While spinning a scythe, hurls a phantom copy of it straight at your cursor once per second, dealing 50% of its damage
					The phantom does not generate soul essence
					'''
				DisplayName: Soul of the Scythe
			}

			RadiantHolyAnkh: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					'Holy light shines through the soul'

					While spinning a scythe, hurls a radiant phantom of it straight at your cursor once per second, dealing 60% of its damage
					The phantom can generate soul essence

					Phantom hits inflict Holy Glare and Tuned
					Enemies afflicted with Holy Glare and Tuned take 25% more damage

					Each time you gain soul essence this way, nearby allies heal for 1% of their maximum life
					Consuming soul essence grants nearby allies a Bulwark Bubble for 5 seconds

					'Who needs backup?!'
					'''
				DisplayName: Radiant Holy Ankh
			}

			Anubis: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					'Death keeps watch over its prey'

					While spinning a scythe, hurls a phantom copy of it straight at your cursor once per second, dealing 75% of its damage
					The phantom does not generate soul essence

					Killing an enemy with the phantom restores 3 life
					Phantom hits inflict Holy Glare
					Enemies afflicted with Holy Glare take 15% more damage
					'''
				DisplayName: Anubis
			}

			InspirationWirelessHeadphones: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Increases maximum inspiration by 5
					Each unique empowerment you have increases your movement speed by 2% and playing speed by 1%
					Every 70 inspiration spent grants Overflowing Inspiration for 5 seconds
					'''
				DisplayName: Wireless Inspiration Headset
			}

			OrchestraConductorScore: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					12% increased symphonic damage
					12% increased symphonic playing speed
					Increases inspiration regeneration rate by 12%
					When you and a nearby ally attack the same target, the enemy instantly takes 30% of the combined damage
					This effect can only trigger once every 2 seconds on the same target
					'''
				DisplayName: Conductor's Score
			}

			CrystalKineticConverter: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Increases inspiration regeneration rate by 10%
					The symphonic damage you deal is stored to a maximum capacity of 1500
					When full, all stored damage is consumed to activate Crystal Shock Absorption
					When activated, you and nearby allies gain 15% increased damage and 10 armor penetration for 30 seconds
					Each nearby ally increases your symphonic playing speed by 5%
					'''
				DisplayName: Crystal Shock Absorber
			}

			SoulMachineSigil: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Increases whip range by 15%
					Increases your max number of sentries by 1
					Decreases your max number of minions by 1
					Hitting an enemy with a whip applies a special mark
					Your next sentry attack against a marked enemy deals 25% more damage
					'''
				DisplayName: Soul Machine Sigil (Test Accessory)
			}

			DarkMatterGauntlet: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Increases melee knockback
					15% increased melee damage
					15% increased melee speed
					Enables auto swing for melee weapons and whips, and increases the size of melee weapons
					Dealing melee damage builds kinetic energy, up to 100
					Every 25 kinetic energy increases melee speed by 3% and melee weapon size by 5%
					At 100 kinetic energy, melee damage is increased by an additional 15%
					Lose 25 kinetic energy for every 5 seconds without dealing melee damage
					'''
				DisplayName: Dark Matter Gauntlet
			}

			DemonBloodGauntlet: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Increases defense by 9
					Reduces damage taken by 5%
					Increases melee knockback
					15% increased melee speed
					Enables auto swing for melee weapons and whips, and increases the size of melee weapons
					Enemies are more likely to target you
					Non-lethal hits have a 20% chance to deal no damage and heal you for that amount instead
					'''
				DisplayName: Demon Blood Gauntlet
			}

			SoulHunterGlove: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Increases defense by 1
					Melee weapon attacks have a 15% chance to strike an additional time
					'''
				DisplayName: Soul Hunter Glove
			}

			TitanBracer: {
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Increases defense by 3
					Melee weapon swings have a 25% chance to strike an additional time
					This effect cannot be triggered by projectiles
					Melee critical hits deal 225% damage instead of 200%
					'''
